Then what you need.

254
00:09:19,216 --> 00:09:20,743
Then exactly what a grid

255
00:09:20,743 --> 00:09:22,194
bot does, order by order.

256
00:09:23,194 --> 00:09:24,311
Then market regimes.

257
00:09:24,887 --> 00:09:26,954
Then choosing grid spacing and range.

258
00:09:27,593 --> 00:09:29,200
Then entry and exit rules.

