268
00:09:49,726 --> 00:09:52,103
In short: a grid waits, it buys lower and

269
00:09:52,103 --> 00:09:54,480
sells higher while price bounces, the

270
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,780
fees come out of the gap, and if a daily

271
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:59,233
close leaves and stays out, you stop the

272
00:09:59,233 --> 00:10:01,304
bot and follow the rule you wrote.

273
00:10:02,388 --> 00:10:03,254
Check yourself.

274
00:10:03,774 --> 00:10:05,226
Why does a grid start with

275
00:10:05,226 --> 00:10:06,679
some coin as well as cash?

276
00:10:06,842 --> 00:10:08,127
Because the sell orders

277
00:10:08,127 --> 00:10:09,636
need coin you already hold.

